# Not required to run the dashboard.
#
# V1 computes the executive briefing deterministically in
# utils/ai_insights.py, so no API key and no network call are involved.
# This file documents the next step only: when narrate() is swapped for a
# model call, add `anthropic` to requirements.txt and set the key below
# (locally in .env, on Streamlit Cloud under Settings -> Secrets).
#
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# AI_MODEL=claude-sonnet-4-5
